Task 1: Import assert.yml file
Description Task 1: Run the assert.yml file as a task, on the localhost, to import any necessary tasks or variables, and only run it once.

Task 2: Install prerequisites
Description Task 2: Install packages specified in the vault_prerequisites variable.

