Inputs:
- Original generation prompt: 
Below you will receive task descriptions from which you should generate an Ansible Playbook.

The generated playbook must be valid inside an Ansible Role under the tasks/ directory (e.g., tasks/main.yml).
Do not include hosts:, vars:, or any playbook-level headers. Only output valid task entries or blocks as expected in a role.

Task 1: Import assert.yml file
Description Task 1: Run the assert.yml file as a task, on the localhost, to import any necessary tasks or variables, and only run it once.

Task 2: Install prerequisites
Description Task 2: Install packages specified in the vault_prerequisites variable.

Task 3: Include installation method specific tasks
Description Task 3: Include tasks from a file that matches the installation method specified in the vault_installation_method variable, to handle different installation methods.

Task 4: Add Vault environment variables
Description Task 4: Add environment variables to the /etc/vault.d/vault.env file, using the vault_environment_settings variable, and restart the vault service.

Task 5: Include hardening tasks
Description Task 5: Include tasks from the hardening.yml file to apply hardening configurations.

Task 6: Start and enable vault on OSS
Description Task 6: Start and enable the vault service if the vault_type variable is set to "oss".

Task 7: Enable vault (non-OSS)
Description Task 7: Enable the vault service if the vault_type variable is not set to "oss".


- Last generated (faulty) playbook: 
---
- name: Import assert.yml file
  import_tasks: assert.yml
  when: true
  run_once: true
  delegate_to: localhost

- name: Install prerequisites
  package:
    name: "{{ vault_prerequisites }}"
    state: present

- name: Include installation method specific tasks
  include_tasks: "{{ vault_installation_method }}.yml"

- name: Add Vault environment variables
  lineinfile:
    path: /etc/vault.d/vault.env
    create: yes
    line: "{{ item }}"
  loop: "{{ vault_environment_settings }}"
  notify: restart vault

- name: Include hardening tasks
  import_tasks: hardening.yml

- name: Start and enable vault on OSS
  service:
    name: vault
    state: started
    enabled: yes
  when: vault_type == "oss"

- name: Enable vault (non-OSS)
  service:
    name: vault
    enabled: yes
  when: vault_type != "oss"

